# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - The Mean endpoint is the arithmetic mean of per-atom force-vector error norms (a vector MAE), averaged over five seeds. The validation-selected stratum and high-force tail endpoints (also means) and the high-novelty RMS endpoint of Table 2, the 1 % and 5 % budgets and the Random selector are not encoded.
